Item Model Fix (Itamio port for Minecraft 26.3)

This mod is an unofficial port of "Item Model Fix" by PepperCode1
(https://github.com/PepperCode1/Item-Model-Fix, LGPL-3.0-only),
originally for Minecraft 1.19.2 (Fabric).

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to
PepperCode1. This port was created by Itamio to bring the mod to
Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric) because the original has not been updated
to this version.

Itamio does not take credit for any of the original assets or logic.
The code was updated to be compatible with Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric).

Port status: the original mod hooked the old baked-model
ItemModelGenerator (ModelElement-based). That generator was removed
in 26.3's new cuboid model system
(net.minecraft.client.resources.model.cuboid.ItemModelGenerator,
which bakes QuadCollections instead of ModelElements), so the
original outline/pixel/unlerp generation modes cannot be ported
mechanically. This port ships the original config, generation-type
enum, and UV/pixel utilities (MathUtil, PixelDirection) and loads
on 26.3; reimplementing the generation modes against the new
QuadCollection baking pipeline is future work, documented in README.

Branch note: the Fabric/1.21.1 branch is a FULL port — on 1.21.1 the old
baked-model ItemModelGenerator still exists, so the original
VANILLA/UNLERP/OUTLINE/PIXEL generation logic works there via the
original ItemModelGeneratorMixin. Only the main (26.3) branch is a
partial port, because 26.3 removed that generator.
